wave of 64 lanes, 4-byte words; columns: banks / lanes served together
access pattern (word address of lane l)         32 / 64    32 / 32    64 / 64
same word for all lanes (broadcast): 0*l              1          2          1
row of a tile: 1*l                                    2          2          1
every second word: 2*l                                4          4          2
stride 4: 4*l                                         8          8          4
stride 16: 16*l                                      32         32         16
stride 32: 32*l                                      64         64         32
stride 33 (pitch 33): 33*l                            2          2          1
column of tile[64][64]: 64*l                         64         64         64
column of tile[64][65]: 65*l                          2          2          1
column 5 of tile[64][64], XOR swizzle                 2          2          1
lower bound for 64 different words: 64 words / banks = 2, 2 and 1 passes
